  "name": "keepers_are_capped_so_gossip_does_not_grow_with_the_mesh",
  "description": "Every keeper sends a digest every five seconds, so gossip traffic grows with the number of keepers rather than with the size of the mesh. The cap is what keeps a large installation from spending its bandwidth talking about itself. Five is the low end of the five-to-seven the data model allows, chosen because three is what makes a healed partition converge and two spare copies beyond that is enough for a house.",
